{"labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le01ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le01ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn4le01ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Want delicious food, amazing attractions and fantastic shopping? Paris is one of the most fascinating and beautiful cities in Europe. This famous city is popular for its cafes, designer boutiques, museums and historical buildings.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn4le01ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Attractions</span><br>\nIn the city centre, there are landmarks and monuments like the Eiffel Tower, the Louvre and the Notre-Dame cathedral. Paris is also famous for its fashion and  designer boutiques. Browse the shops on your way down the Champs \u00c9lys\u00e9es. Spend one day strolling off the beaten path and see how Parisians live. Cross the bridge over the Seine river that runs through the city. Visit the local markets near the Panth\u00e9on.", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "image": "engenn4le01ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Food</span><br>\nFrench cuisine is world-class. Enjoy the great food and lively atmosphere in a French cafe on a side street or book a table for dinner at a romantic restaurant.", "id": 3, "time": "51000", "image": "engenn4le01ob08re2img03.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Accommodation and Transportation</span></br>\nThere are hundreds of hotels to choose from.  Many are close to the attractions.\nParis has  great public transport. The cost for a daily train pass is not expensive.\n<br><br>\nDon't you want to visit?", "id": 4, "time": "64000", "image": "engenn4le01ob08re2img04.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "p