 or town."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}], "template_override": 1}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "It's Time to Travel"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Short City Guide"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Describing Cities"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are many ways to describe a city.  You can also use nouns to talk about a city.<br><br> 1. You can talk about the <span class=\"strong\">quality</span> of life."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example:\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The cost of living</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How much do things cost? Is it an expensive city to live in?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The pace of life </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Is life slow or very busy?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Pollution </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Is the air clean? Is there a lot of garbage?</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "2. You can talk about <span class=\"strong\">areas</span> in a city."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example:\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Suburbs</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The area where people live in houses near a larger city</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">City Centre</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The main or central part of a city</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Outskirts</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The parts of a city or town that are far from the center</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Inner City</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The central section of a large city where mostly poor people live</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "3. You can use adjectives to describe a city."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"crowded\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"expensive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"polluted\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" busy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" lively\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" modern\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" beautiful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"noisy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" pleasant\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" historic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ancient\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" exciting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" large\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" small\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"relaxed\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Paris is a beautiful and historic city.</span> "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">There are many designer boutiques with expensive clothes.</span> "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">The attractions are very crowded in the summer.</span> "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lively"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "full of energy, excitement, or feeling"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I enjoyed the lively atmosphere in the restaurant."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you write about a city."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fascinating"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very interesting or appealing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Paris is a fascinating city."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "off the beaten path"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not known or popular with many people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(idiom)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Take a walk off the beaten path."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "attraction"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a well-known place in a city"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We saw a lot of attractions in the city."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "monument"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a building, statue, etc., that honors a person or event"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many famous monuments in paris"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "public transport"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "trains and buses in a city"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Paris has great public transport."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "world-class"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "of very high quality"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Paris has a world-class transportation system."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le01ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Write a short city guide."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Include the headings: <span class=\"italic\">Introduction</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Attractions</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Food</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Accommodation</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Transport</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Use adjectives to describe your city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write in sentences and use capital letters and periods."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your guide aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I include headings in my city guide."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use adjectives to describe my city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use correct punctuation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my guide aloud."}]}], "type": "sena"}